# Density Compare
# Nitrogen (N) — real density 0.00125 g/cm³. equal masses: Nitrogen vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Nitrogen Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 185.5mm color: #3050f8 at (-20mm, 92.7mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 0.0 g — the water cube is the reference
